      "statement": "install.sh computes the archive SHA256 with sha256_of, which prefers sha256sum on GNU/Linux and falls back to shasum -a 256 on macOS; verify_checksum parses the sums file accepting both 'hash  name' and 'hash *name' sha256sum output formats, treating the SHA256 comparison as the mandatory fatal gate (a mismatch or missing entry exits 1).",
