      "statement": "SECURITY.md is the authoritative threat-model and release-verification document for these install channels: it specifies the manual gh attestation verify --signer-workflow command matching install.sh, confirms the SHA256 checksum is the mandatory integrity gate across channels (provenance is advisory), and notes provenance does not apply to Homebrew third-party-tap installs, which are limited to the formula's SHA256.",
